WEBVTT

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:03.900
Enemy penetration is at 70%...

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.650
We can’t hold them off much longer...

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.440
Mishakuji Yukari and Gojo Sukuna...

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:13.490
Their tactic is simple:
Overwhelm with brute force.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:17.660
Yet it shows how much confidence
they have in their own abilities.

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:20.450
They’re just messing with us.

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:23.080
Oh my...

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.290
Another trap to try and stall us?

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.960
This is getting a little tiresome.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.380
My orders are to destroy as many traps as possible

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:33.340
to clear the way for our king...

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.470
I know that’s part of my duty...

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:40.270
Caw! Duty! Duty!

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:42.600
Still...

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:47.310
I want my fights to be more beautiful!

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.400
Hey, we’ll be more than happy to grant your wish!

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:11.800
We’ll give you a beautiful send-off!

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.970
Phase 2 of the plan to neutralize JUNGLE...

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:18.680
Concentrate our military power
in Cloud Hall on the 75th floor,

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:21.470
and crush the Green clansmen one by one.

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:24.020
Everything is going as planned so far, but...

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:29.730
Detecting massive Wiseman levels
near the aboveground floors!

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:30.860
It’s moving!

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:32.610
He’s here...

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:34.190
The Green King!

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:37.110
It’s me.

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:38.660
I’m going in.

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:13.710
It’s so good to see him up and running!

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:18.050
Looking back, it’s been nine years since he fought with the Gold King Kokujoji Daikaku.

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:21.090
And over a decade since the Kagutsu Incident...

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:24.890
We’ve been in the shadows for ages.

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:29.560
I mean, that old fart just wouldn’t die.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:36.360
But now Kokujoji’s finally gone.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:39.860
And that means there’s no one in this world

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:43.570
that can stop you at full power, Nagare.

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:46.200
That’s it, Nagare!

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.620
Run as much as you want!

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:50.660
Iwa-san’s got your back...

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:53.000
So go and have a blast!

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:57.630
Holy crap...

00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:59.380
That was close!

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:02.970
That noise...

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:04.180
More of ‘em?

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:06.140
C’mon, Blues!

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:08.010
Hurry up and get into position!

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:11.180
Oh my... Here already?

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.020
“Here already”?

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:14.400
You don’t mean...

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.940
Yes, that’s right.

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.650
He’s coming...

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:22.070
How unfortunate.

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:24.030
Truly unfortunate.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:28.200
Just when things were starting to get exciting...

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:30.330
But now it’s all over.

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:32.040
Over! Over!

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.170
It’s over?

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:36.290
So it is the Green King!

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:38.290
I didn’t expect him so soon...

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.800
Hey, what’s wrong with you guys!
Quit acting like cowards!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:43.840
So what if it’s a king or clansmen?

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:45.550
Who the hell cares!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:49.310
We’ll just crush anyone who comes at us!

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:50.560
Show some spirit!

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:54.230
Oh, I like this boy’s enthusiasm.

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:56.440
But I was talking about me when I said unfortunate!

00:04:58.810 --> 00:04:59.820
Huh?! Hey!

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:03.320
After all, my part in all this is over...

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:06.110
Shiro!

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:07.910
Yeah.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:11.080
Sounds like he’s decided to make his move.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:14.330
It’s sooner than I had expected...

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.960
What’ll we do, Shiro?

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:18.960
Who said you guys could talk?!

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:27.930
Damn it!

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:29.800
Stop fooling around!

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.760
Fight me for real!

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.520
Gojo Sukuna.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:37.770
This battle is not a single combat
where the winner determines the outcome of war.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:42.530
Nothing’s more important than winning a game!

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:44.820
You gotta risk everything!

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:46.650
I’m betting my life!

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:49.370
So you’re willing to throw your life away...

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.290
Then you leave me with no choice!

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:54.000
He’s coming with a big move.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.830
Counter the instant he swings.

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.040
Understood.

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:00.790
I’ll take out all of you!

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:05.130
<i>The sun is setting</i>

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:06.920
<i>Those who chose to</i> <i>leave their homes</i>

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.550
<i>And those who return</i>

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:10.800
Mishakuji Yukari!

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:12.220
Yukari!

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:13.760
Who said you could interrupt?!

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:15.810
Interrupt! Interrupt!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.140
Kuroh-chan...

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.520
I see being reunited with the Silver King

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:23.320
has made you even more handsome than ever.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:28.030
Understandable, since you only use
your sword to protect your king.

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:30.820
It’s what defines your selfless nature.

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:33.910
Are you here to assist your comrade?

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.450
Mishakuji Yukari...

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:36.950
That’s playing dirty!

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:39.710
I don’t need your help!

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.340
“Assist”? “Help”?

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:45.710
I would never do anything so tasteless.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:50.010
I just came by to pick up our boy.

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:52.140
Time to go, Sukuna-chan.

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:54.970
Caw! Withdraw! Withdraw!

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:56.520
No way!

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:58.350
I’m staying to fight!

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:00.900
Don’t be so difficult, Sukuna.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:05.820
A child throwing tantrums is very unsightly.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.860
Besides...

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:11.160
I’ve already decided that Kuroh-chan is mine.

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:14.740
When the time comes,
I’ll get to have him all to myself...

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:18.580
Hah! And you say <i>I’m</i> selfish?!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:30.010
Alas, Kuroh-chan, we just weren’t
destined to face each other tonight.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:33.390
But I’m sure we’ll meet again real soon...

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:39.390
<i>On that fateful day when</i>
<i>we settle things once and for all.</i>

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.650
What’s with that pansy?

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.570
After all the fuss he creates getting up here,

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:48.690
he just decides to run off!

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:50.780
Talk about anticlimactic!

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:55.200
Where am I supposed to throw
all this frustration at, huh?!

00:07:55.990 --> 00:08:00.250
So the kid you were handling...

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.830
Right, Gojo Sukuna...

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:06.920
He retreated along with Mishakuji Yukari?

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.840
I understand.

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:13.720
It’s sooner than scheduled,
but we’ll move on to Phase 3.

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:15.390
All right, Shiro-san.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:17.760
We’ll be waiting at the top.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.640
Please be careful.

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:25.020
<i>Fushimi, we’re starting Phase 3.</i>

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.310
<i>Is everything ready?</i>

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:27.820
I was ready hours ago.

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:30.780
Mihashira Tower will now go into total lockdown,

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:33.820
including all communication and power systems.

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:35.950
This will isolate the Green King.

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:42.790
Hereafter, communication will be limited
to the Red King’s psychic powers,

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:44.040
so please be cautious.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:45.580
<i>Understood.</i>

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:46.670
All right...

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.340
Initiate emergency building lockdown.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:49.460
Yes, sir!

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:51.340
Initiating emergency building lockdown!

00:08:56.470 --> 00:09:00.850
I won’t let you use the routes opened up
by your henchmen, Green King.

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:08.560
There are no lights along the corridors

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:11.070
and your voice will reach no one.

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:16.450
Furthermore, multiple layers of
thick walls obstruct your way.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:21.790
The entire Mihashira Tower has
now become a prison, just for you.

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:28.880
Obviously, a trap like this could
never stop a king such as yourself.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:36.340
However, each trap is sure to eat away
at your limited time and strength.

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:39.550
You’ll need to break through
a hundred walls and get past two kings...

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:43.640
Now then, let’s see if you can make it this far...

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:47.480
Green King, Hisui Nagare.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.530
Are these...

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:59.160
The damage left behind by Hisui Nagare?

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:01.240
His destructive power is simply amazing.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:01.870
Yeah...

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:02.620
Wow!

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:03.200
He’s using up his power at an alarming rate.

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:05.330
We’re so high up!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:05.500
It’s so pretty outside!

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:08.250
His speed is far greater than I expected.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:12.210
But, there’s no way he can maintain his stamina.

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:16.630
Isn’t that exactly what you wanted?

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:19.840
Yes, but it’s faster than I expected.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:23.140
It’s as though he has no intention
of saving his strength to begin with.

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:25.430
What is he up to?

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:27.480
Something doesn’t feel right.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:29.020
Shiro!

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:32.150
Shiro! Hurry up!

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:32.730
So you’re saying...

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:33.860
Come on! Let’s hurry!

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.030
Anna’s in danger...!

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:37.740
Hurry!

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:39.030
Meow?!

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:43.330
Remember, Anna will be
the key player to this mission.

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:47.580
There’s not much we can do
during the fight between kings.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:49.540
We’ll only get in her way.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:51.960
Soon, Isana Yashiro...

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:53.920
the Silver King will join us.

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.920
Shiro-san will defend and Anna will attack.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:59.590
The rest of us are all there for diversion and support.

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:00.590
Okay?

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:01.760
You got that?

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:02.800
Yeah!

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:06.720
What about you, Yata-chan? You got it?

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:10.310
I’m not supposed to get carried away
and jump into battle, right?

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.820
Even at a time like this...

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:18.070
You HOMRA are full of energy...

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:23.120
I beg your pardon, Red King.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.160
We’re connected.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:26.700
Huh?

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:31.710
We’re all connected deep down.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:33.330
That’s why...

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:36.340
Our fire will never go out.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:40.220
What I don’t get is the Blue King...

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:43.010
He’s making Anna...

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:46.310
HOMRA’s king, risk her life,

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:49.810
while he gets to kick back and chill up there!

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:53.600
Who the hell does he think he is?

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:56.480
Yata, we went over this at the meeting.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:12:01.110
We can’t afford to draw the Green King
into the Chamber of Slates.

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:05.740
It’ll be worse if all of us are here and
he still manages to break through.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:10.040
Which is why Anna and Shiro-san’s job is
to force the enemy to use up his power.

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:12.460
So that in the event he gets past us,

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:15.580
the Blue King will be ready to stop him for sure.

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:16.880
That’s the plan.

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:21.720
No, I’m not complaining about the strategy itself...

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:27.140
I’m talking more about his attitude,
and you know... honor.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:32.270
I just don’t get why anyone
would want to follow him.

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:35.650
The guy’s a dishonest bastard.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:37.940
Ow!

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:39.110
Dumbass!

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.690
Stop making such a huge fuss
over other people’s business.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.450
Sorry, Seri-chan.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:47.780
Oh, I didn’t mean you...

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:52.040
Again?!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:02.170
Everyone, get back.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:03.170
What?

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:06.180
He’s coming...

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:43.510
Oww...

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:45.840
Shit, I didn’t see that coming!

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:48.470
So that’s the Green King?!

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:49.090
Anna!

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:55.520
Are you hurt?!

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.900
I’m going...

00:13:57.900 --> 00:14:00.230
I must stop him.

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:05.240
Anna!

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:13.120
Why hello, Red King Kushina Anna.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:16.540
Please forgive my rude entry back there.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:17.750
I was in a hurry.

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:19.040
My sincere apologies.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:22.170
Green King Hisui Nagare.

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:23.840
Give it up.

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:26.220
We can’t let you have it.

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:29.550
The Slates is not your toy.

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:33.680
You’re right. It’s not my toy.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:35.060
I agree with you there.

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:39.350
A world where players who’ve awakened
to powers beyond that of a human...

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:41.610
can compete to reach the top.

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:45.860
The Dresden Slates is a system
that serves that purpose.

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:49.240
In other words, it doesn’t belong to me alone.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:50.990
It is a toy that belongs to everyone.

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:52.240
Stop.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:55.910
I will not stop, nor can I be stopped.

00:14:55.910 --> 00:15:00.170
Kushina Anna, I <i>will</i> reach my goal.

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:01.500
I said, stop!

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:19.180
You’ve only been a king for a short time...

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:22.440
Yet you seem to have
great control over its power.

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:23.940
I’m impressed.

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:27.820
You don’t understand
the meaning of this power.

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:31.320
Power itself has no meaning.

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:35.950
It’s the people who wield power
that gives it meaning.

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:37.700
That’s not true!

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:43.210
Fine, we’ve confirmed we are at odds.

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:46.750
Now then, let the games... begin!

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.650
A lightning beast?!

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:12.860
Anna and Hisui Nagare
are battling each other.

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:14.110
Look, Shiro!

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:32.420
I am here at last.

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:34.130
I’ve reached my goal!

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:37.390
Sorry, no goal yet.

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:53.530
It’s time!

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:55.070
He’s used up his power.

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:04.040
Anna! Munakata-san!

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:16.260
How was it, Hisui Nagare?

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:19.350
Did you enjoy your rampage?

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:21.970
There was no intelligence
or order in your behavior.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:26.310
You may as well have been
just... an animal.

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:31.440
Oh, it was so much fun, Munakata Reisi.

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:34.570
By the way, humans are all animals.

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.780
We are just individual living creatures

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:39.160
that happen to be different from one another.

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.080
Isn’t that right?

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:42.830
Ameno Miyabi?

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:45.040
Huh... me?

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:48.330
I’m Neko!

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:50.420
Ameno Miyabi...

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:52.800
Even with SCEPTER 4’s resources,

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:54.510
we could not deduce that girl’s identity.

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:57.510
So that’s her real name?

00:17:57.510 --> 00:18:04.850
However, isn’t she a bit too unique
to use as an example of ordinary humans?

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:08.350
You believe that because you’re a fool.

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:10.770
She and I are the same...

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:14.400
We define ourselves without being bound

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.860
by the human qualities that are forced upon us.

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:21.990
The state of that free spirit governs
the possibilities that humans possess.

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:26.160
And now, I... the one nearest to that ideal...

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:28.750
have come to receive the Slates.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:32.380
Are you going to imply that
you are the most suitable one

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:35.340
to manage the Slates?

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:37.010
Such arrogance.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:40.180
Don’t misunderstand, Munakata Reisi.

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:46.140
It’s impossible for anyone to be
“suitable” to manage the Dresden Slates.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:48.640
That is the wellspring of possibilities,

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:51.900
and to think one can arbitrarily control it

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:55.320
shows a total lack of understanding of its true nature.

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:56.650
It’s absurd.

00:18:56.650 --> 00:19:01.820
I see. Don’t manage power, just release it...

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:06.540
Inviting chaos is the meaning
of the Slates’ existence...

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:09.000
Is that what you want to say?

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:11.790
There is no meaning.

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:16.800
Those with power shall use it
in any way they want. That’s all.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:21.800
Yet look at you now...
Your power is exhausted.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:24.680
How do you view the situation you’re in?

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:31.600
Hisui Nagare,
you are already a dead man.

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:34.190
According to the Silver King’s data,

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:37.820
you lost your heart during
the Kagutsu Incident.

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:42.160
Your power is what’s barely
sustaining your existence.

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:47.330
It also explains how you’re able to manipulate your physical capabilities to such extreme.

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:50.910
However, once your power is used up...

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:54.210
You’re like a toy with a dead battery...

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:58.960
Or rather, your original self...
nothing but a corpse.

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:06.470
I hardly think you are qualified to battle me
for the right to possess the Slates.

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:09.270
You’re right.

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:13.350
But I’m not the one you’ll be fighting.

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:17.900
“He” will be coming through
the path I have cleared.

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:19.730
“He” is my trump card.

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:22.530
Come on!

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:24.490
Anna’s in danger!

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:27.160
Show some guts, you bastards!

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.490
Yeah!

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:32.080
It’s good to have Yata-chan at times like these.

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:34.330
Huh?!

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:38.000
Where’d this fog come from?

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:42.470
Everyone! Be careful!

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:44.380
Yata!

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:45.720
Kamamoto!

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.050
Seri-chan!

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:06.820
Who the hell are you?!

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:16.920
Who was that guy?

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:18.630
Oh no... Anna!

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:21.920
An unknown sanctum just
appeared inside the tower!

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:23.550
It’s a King, sir!

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:25.510
What...?!

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:26.890
Vertical over...

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:28.760
A Sword of Damocles is manifesting itself!

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:34.560
Impossible! A <i>fifth</i> King?!

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:53.160
Munakata-san!

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:54.370
I see...

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:58.500
Hisui Nagare’s reckless actions
and inexplicable confidence...

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:02.420
are explained by the fact that
you were behind this all along...

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:09.390
The one who was said to have died
during the Kagutsu Incident...

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:11.180
The Sixth King...

00:22:11.180 --> 00:22:12.930
The Gray King!

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:16.180
Whoa, wait a sec, Munakata.

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:19.230
The beginning is crucial in human relationships.

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:22.150
So I just have one thing to say first.

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:23.940
If you’re going to address me...

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:26.900
Then just call me... Iwa-san!

00:23:57.580 --> 00:23:59.910
The final sword that remained hidden until now...

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:01.290
Gray.

00:24:01.290 --> 00:24:03.920
Next time on <i>K: Return of Kings,</i>

00:24:03.920 --> 00:24:06.170
#8 “Kaput”.

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:08.460
You’re a pretty unfair person...

00:24:08.460 --> 00:24:11.300
But also very tragic...
